  "@type": "AnalogicalMapping",
  "instance_name": "mapping_id_1",
  "label": "The subjects are mapped as squeaky toys",
  "description": "The top text 'i bet they make squeaky toy sounds' maps the visual subjects (the man and woman in the portrait) onto the conceptual category of 'squeaky toys'. This is an infantilizing and dehumanizing analogical mapping, reducing the dignified historical subjects to the level of children's toys, which is a form of objectification and degradation. The mapping is established through the direct textual projection of the subjects' identity onto the metaphor of squeaky toys.",
